      (justify left top))
    (uuid "79837953-b74e-4e89-9d9b-99dd907a0a10"))
  (text "Foinse distributes two battery supplies: 2S to Croi and 6S to propulsion. Their positive rails never join.\nIt protects the sources without a microcontroller. Croi reads voltage, current and temperature measurements.\nStart with the source pages, then the connections and monitors. External on/off contacts are on page 12."
    (at 22.86 30.48 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a9614a8a-5713-4e86-8a0a-331eca6119f0"))
